  ## 5. Summary of How Everything Connects

    1. Service boots up ────────► Registers with local NodeAgent via REST API
    2. NodeAgent updates ───────► Adds instance with TTL lease to local ServiceRegistry
    3. Gossip Engine ───────────► Disseminates registration to other nodes via UDP gossip
    4. Health Monitor ──────────► Periodically sends HTTP probes to service /health
    5. Healthy Instances ───────► Aggregated into an immutable BackendSnapshot
    6. HTTP Load Balancer ──────► Atomically reads BackendSnapshot & routes client requests
    7. Prometheus / Grafana ────► Scrapes /metrics every 2 seconds for real-time observability
    8. Node crash occurs ───────► SWIM failure detector detects missing ACK -> SUSPECT -> DEAD
    9. Snapshot updates ────────► Dead backend evicted with zero dropped client requests

